<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>v3 - Launcher</title>
<HTA:APPLICATION
  ID="V3Launcher"
  APPLICATIONNAME="v3 Launcher"
  SINGLEINSTANCE="yes"
  WINDOWSTATE="normal"
  SCROLL="no"
  CONTEXTMENU="no"
/>
<style>
body{font-family:"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;background:#070d1d;color:#d8e2ff;margin:0;padding:24px;}
.card{background:#0e152b;border:1px solid #7e93ff;border-radius:12px;padding:20px;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;}
h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:20px;color:#fff;}
.sub{color:#8ea1d8;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:16px;}
button{display:block;width:100%;margin:8px 0;padding:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #7e93ff;cursor:pointer;}
.primary{background:#7e93ff;color:#081021;}
.ghost{background:transparent;color:#d8e2ff;}
.hint{font-size:12px;color:#8ea1d8;margin-top:12px;line-height:1.5;}
code{background:#080e1f;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;color:#98f3cc;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="card">
<h1>v3 - Comet Beta Autonomous Agent</h1>
<div class="sub">Easy starter - preview the side panel, then load as unpacked extension.</div>
<button class="primary" onclick="VBScript:OpenPanel">1 - Preview Side Panel</button>
<button class="ghost" onclick="VBScript:OpenExtensions">2 - Open Chrome Extensions Page</button>
<button class="ghost" onclick="VBScript:OpenFolder">3 - Open Project Folder</button>
<div class="hint">After Step 1, install fully: open <code>chrome://extensions</code> -&gt; Developer mode -&gt; Load unpacked -&gt; select the <code>v3</code> folder.<br>Set API keys in the side panel (BYOK routing).</div>
</div>
<script language="VBScript">
Dim sh, fso
Set sh = CreateObject("WScript.Shell")
Set fso = CreateObject("Scripting.FileSystemObject")
Function GetBase()
  Dim p
  p = Unescape(document.location.pathname)
  If Left(p, 1) = "/" Then p = Mid(p, 2)
  p = Replace(p, "/", "\")
  GetBase = fso.GetParentFolderName(p)
End Function
Sub OpenPanel()
  Dim target
  target = fso.BuildPath(GetBase(), "sidepanel.html")
  sh.Run Chr(34) & target & Chr(34), 1, False
End Sub
Sub OpenExtensions()
  sh.Run "chrome.exe chrome://extensions", 1, False
End Sub
Sub OpenFolder()
  sh.Run Chr(34) & GetBase() & Chr(34), 1, False
End Sub
</script>
</body>
</html>
